      "body": "## \ud83c\udfaf Changes\r\n\r\nWe've fallen multiple versions behind. It still works after simply running the upgrade command. Importantly, look at the lockfile improvements! More culling to come...\r\n\r\n- Expo 53: https://expo.dev/changelog/sdk-53\r\n- Expo 54: https://expo.dev/changelog/sdk-54\r\n- Expo 55: https://expo.dev/changelog/sdk-55\r\n- Expo 56: https://expo.dev/changelog/sdk-56\r\n- Expo 57: https://expo.dev/changelog/sdk-57\r\n\r\n## \u2705 Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed the steps in the [Contributing guide](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\r\n- [x] I have tested code changes locally with `pnpm run test:pr`, or these tests do not apply to this pull request.\r\n- [x] I fully understand the code in this pull request, including any code generated with AI assistance.\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\ude80 Release Impact\r\n\r\n- [ ] This change affects published code, and I have generated a [changeset](https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/docs/adding-a-changeset.md).\r\n- [x] This change is docs/CI/dev-only (no release).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated the React Native example\u2019s mobile framework and supporting packages to newer versions, including updates to its Expo, navigation, animation, and interface libraries. These changes apply to the example project\u2019s setup; no new end-user features or changes to the app\u2019s visible behavior are noted.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
